## Auxiliary/school institutions such as animator/animator-surveying canteen and worker/measures and cleaning

City of Locarno — public competition in Locarno (TI), Switzerland.

Bastian Lerch BL/cz 20 July 2026 ADVISO DI CONCORSO IL MUNICIPIO DI LOCARNO makes it known that the competition for the indefinite time assignment of one/one is open: auxiliary/school institutes as animator/animator-surveying canteen and attendant/meaning and cleaning at our school canteen for pupils and primary school students. The function of animator-sorvegliante canteen and dedicated to mescita and cleanliness provides surveillance and service such as the accompaniment of the students from/to the school office, as well as the distribution of meals to children and girls and the cleaning and reorganization of the spaces used for the refection. The commitment focuses on four working days (Monday, Tuesday, Thursday and Friday) in the hourly period between 11.15 and 14.15 and coincides with the school calendar. The position is already occupied by staff in charge. Required Requirements
• proven experience in the field of childhood with groups of children (summer colonies, afterschool animators, extra-school activities, day families, Scout camps, Youth and Sport, ...);
• ease of work in contact with children at school age (3-6 years) and strong relational skills.
• excellent knowledge of the Italian language (understanding and spoken at level C2 or above)
• sense of responsibility, reliability and guidance to quality and attitude to work both independent and in group
• organizational capacity, flexibility and spirit of initiative in respect of the educational continuity of teachers
• attention to hygiene and cleaning.
